 
  Object:   Get to the treasure chest.
 
  Scoring:  When you get to the treasure chest before time expires,
            the remaining time is added to your score.  Picking up
            prizes along the way adds to your remaining time.
 
  Controls: Run and climb by using the cursor control keys.
            Jump with the space bar.  Note that you can jump
            onto a higher level by releasing the cursor key
            to land.  ESC takes you out of the game immediately.
 
  Problem:  SLOW MOTION.  If things suddenly seem to go into slow
            motion, your processor isn't fast enough to update
            all eight barrels during vertical retrace.  Try
            invoking the game like this:
                >aldo 6
            to limit the number of barrels to 6 (minimum is 4).
 
